      <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>MenuDart 1.0.4</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>The Menu Bar Icons popup opens instantly. MenuDart keeps the icon list ready in the background and refreshes it while the popup is open.</li>
          <li>New options: refresh the icon list on a timer, and hide the Dock icon when Settings closes.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
