      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>MenuDart 1.0.1</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Before you buy, MenuDart lets you know about a running sale and when it ends, at most once a day. You can turn it off for that sale.</li>
          <li>During a sale, Buy buttons open checkout with the discount code already filled in.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
