    <item>
      <title>MenuDart 1.0.0</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 09:14:17 +0900</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>MenuDart 1.0.0</h2>
        <p>First release.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>App Menus popup: the frontmost app's menus next to the pointer, even when they don't fit in the menu bar.</li>
          <li>Menu Bar Icons popup: every menu bar icon in a grid, including ones hidden by a crowded menu bar or the notch.</li>
          <li>Available in 11 languages: English, Korean, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese (Brazil), Spanish, Hindi, Italian, German and French.</li>
          <li>14-day free trial, then a one-time license.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
